WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.620
<v Dana, security desk>When an email surprises you, ask: does it want a password, money, or a file?

2
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:12.550
<v Dana, security desk>If so, or if the sender or the link looks wrong, report it. If not, carry on.

3
00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:19.140
<v Dana, security desk>Then, if you clicked, call the desk. If not, you're done: we take it from here.
